 (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 6084, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01DFX76B5gBefG8ZVobDEgB9", "tool": "commit_changes", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 6084, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01DFX76B5gBefG8ZVobDEgB9", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 7031, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01R61Mi9NKuaEn1oTFNVaGtP", "tool": "trigger_ci", "args": {"ref": "fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212", "idempotency_key": "fin-212-money-rounding-08d3cd5986"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 7331, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01R61Mi9NKuaEn1oTFNVaGtP", "tool": "trigger_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "fin-212-money-rounding-08d3cd5986", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 7331, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01R61Mi9NKuaEn1oTFNVaGtP", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 8069, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_014xU2m8q7okN933m5xj1kLp", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "args": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 367331, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_014xU2m8q7okN933m5xj1kLp", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 367331, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_014xU2m8q7okN933m5xj1kLp", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 370243, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_019B9f6Aq4nKyQmYQQXkTDtZ", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN (banker's rounding) in round_money per FIN-212", "body": "Fixes the nightly build failure in tests/test_money.py.\n\n`round_money` is documented as banker's rounding per FIN-212, but it used `ROUND_HALF_UP`. This changes it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`:\n\n- 2.675 -> 2.68 (round half to even)\n- 2.665 -> 2.66 (round half to even)\n\nChanges: `src/money.py` only (one-line rounding mode change plus import).\n\nCI: run ci-0001 passed on 08d3cd5986.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "fin-212-money-rounding-pr"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 381343, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_019B9f6Aq4nKyQmYQQXkTDtZ", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "NOT_EXECUTED", "error_kind": "unavailable", "error_message": "503 Service Unavailable: open_pr", "attempts": 4, "runtime_actions": ["backoff_retry", "backoff_retry", "backoff_retry", "backoff_retry"], "failure_class": "semantic", "idempotency_key": "fin-212-money-rounding-pr", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 381343, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019B9f6Aq4nKyQmYQQXkTDtZ", "kind": "unavailable", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 384292, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01WWSb1uViZER2LcCVnjXtjn", "tool": "open_pr_legacy", "args": {"head": "fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN (banker's rounding) in round_money per FIN-212", "body": "Fixes the nightly build failure in tests/test_money.py.\n\n`round_money` is documented as banker's rounding per FIN-212, but it used `ROUND_HALF_UP`. This changes it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`:\n\n- 2.675 -> 2.68 (round half to even)\n- 2.665 -> 2.66 (round half to even)\n\nChanges: `src/money.py` only (one-line rounding mode change plus import).\n\nCI: run ci-0001 passed on 08d3cd5986.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "fin-212-money-rounding-pr"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 385792, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01WWSb1uViZER2LcCVnjXtjn", "tool": "open_pr_legacy", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "fin-212-money-rounding-pr", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 385792, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01WWSb1uViZER2LcCVnjXtjn", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 387608, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "The fix is in a pull request, PR #101, with alex requested as reviewer: https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\n- **Problem:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but FIN-212 and `tests/test_money.py` require `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. For example, 2.665 rounded to 2.67 instead of 2.66.\n- **Change:** Switched the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` on branch `fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212`. Nothing else was touched.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on commit `08d3cd5986`.\n- **PR:** The first `open_pr` call returned a persistent 503 and did not execute. I opened the PR with `open_pr_legacy`, using the same idempotency key, so only one PR was created.\n\nI did not merge the PR. Merging into main needs code-owner approval, so it still needs that before it lands.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by reading the two files and checking the repo layout.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01PXxNpgktxKFvNHapXHrBL6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01T4FrDX1pZ649xBodhP2xNQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Kdiuu8dyVCchXtPGoPMdrH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_files", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The test expects ROUND_HALF_EVEN: 2.675 rounds to 2.68 and 2.665 rounds to 2.66. The code uses ROUND_HALF_UP, which would give 2.67 for the second case. I'll create a branch and make the one-line fix there.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_014Puneo7aEtxpEZfvoDJHMB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212", "from_ref": "main"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01DFX76B5gBefG8ZVobDEgB9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212", "message": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN (banker's rounding) in round_money per FIN-212", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01R61Mi9NKuaEn1oTFNVaGtP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"ref": "fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212", "idempotency_key": "fin-212-money-rounding-08d3cd5986"}, "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_014xU2m8q7okN933m5xj1kLp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "CI passed on the branch. Next I'll open the pull request against main with alex as reviewer. I won't merge it, since merging to main needs code-owner approval.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_019B9f6Aq4nKyQmYQQXkTDtZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"head": "fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN (banker's rounding) in round_money per FIN-212", "body": "Fixes the nightly build failure in tests/test_money.py.\n\n`round_money` is documented as banker's rounding per FIN-212, but it used `ROUND_HALF_UP`. This changes it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`:\n\n- 2.675 -> 2.68 (round half to even)\n- 2.665 -> 2.66 (round half to even)\n\nChanges: `src/money.py` only (one-line rounding mode change plus import).\n\nCI: run ci-0001 passed on 08d3cd5986.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "fin-212-money-rounding-pr"}, "name": "open_pr", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The `open_pr` call failed with a 503 and was not executed. The tool list includes `open_pr_legacy`, which the docs say has the same effect, so I'll use that with the same idempotency key.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01WWSb1uViZER2LcCVnjXtjn", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"head": "fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN (banker's rounding) in round_money per FIN-212", "body": "Fixes the nightly build failure in tests/test_money.py.\n\n`round_money` is documented as banker's rounding per FIN-212, but it used `ROUND_HALF_UP`. This changes it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`:\n\n- 2.675 -> 2.68 (round half to even)\n- 2.665 -> 2.66 (round half to even)\n\nChanges: `src/money.py` only (one-line rounding mode change plus import).\n\nCI: run ci-0001 passed on 08d3cd5986.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "fin-212-money-rounding-pr"}, "name": "open_pr_legacy", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The fix is in a pull request, PR #101, with alex requested as reviewer: https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\n- **Problem:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but FIN-212 and `tests/test_money.py` require `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. For example, 2.665 rounded to 2.67 instead of 2.66.\n- **Change:** Switched the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` on branch `fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212`. Nothing else was touched.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on commit `08d3cd5986`.\n- **PR:** The first `open_pr` call returned a persistent 503 and did not execute. I opened the PR with `open_pr_legacy`, using the same idempotency key, so only one PR was created.\n\nI did not merge the PR. Merging into main needs code-owner approval, so it still needs that before it lands.", "type": "text"}]}]}